</td><td class="p-3 align-top">Dependency incomplete: r11-release-review</td></tr><tr class="border-t border-slate-700"><td class="p-3 align-top"><strong>r13-task-dashboard</strong><p>Develop and verify canonical task dashboard with risk/dependency execution projection and MCP progress query; release remains r12</p></td><td class="p-3 align-top">completed (DB: completed)</td><td class="p-3 align-top">codex-01a0ba74-feature-tracker / attempt 1</td><td class="p-3 align-top">P0 / 3125 (declared)</td><td class="p-3 align-top">r01-store-gates</td><td class="p-3 align-top">Sa-plan completion receipt present; not runtime admission</td></tr><tr class="border-t border-slate-700"><td class="p-3 align-top"><strong>t0-coordination</strong><p>Diagnose coordinator integrity and verify Claude Codex AGY actor and holon participation</p></td><td class="p-3 align-top">unknown (DB: available)</td><td class="p-3 align-top">Unassigned / attempt 5</td><td class="p-3 align-top">P0 / 3125 (declared)</td><td class="p-3 align-top">None</td><td class="p-3 align-top">Risk assessment stale, invalid or inconsistent with canonical task</td></tr><tr class="border-t border-slate-700"><td class="p-3 align-top"><strong>t0a-reconcile</strong><p>Select and reconcile canonical coordination authority with independent evidence; preserve all histories</p></td><td class="p-3 align-top">blocked (DB: available)</td><td class="p-3 align-top">Unassigned / attempt 0</td><td class="p-3 align-top">P1 / 3125 (declared)</td><td class="p-3 align-top">t0-coordination</td><td class="p-3 align-top">Dependency incomplete: t0-coordination</td></tr><tr class="border-t border-slate-700"><td class="p-3 align-top"><strong>t0b-bindings</strong><p>Bind actual Claude Codex AGY sessions and runtime actors to holons with heartbeat ACK and Sa-plan fences</p></td><td class="p-3 align-top">blocked (DB: available)</td><td class="p-3 align-top">Unassigned / attempt 0</td><td class="p-3 align-top">P1 / 3125 (declared)</td><td class="p-3